---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Llansannan A–Z" title_en="Llansannan A–Z">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1>Llansannan A–Z</h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <a href="/llansannan/">Llansannan</a> &rsaquo;
    A–Z
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Cyfeiriadur yr Ardal A–Z</span><span lang="en">Local Directory A–Z</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Mae'r cyfeiriadur hwn yn cynnig crynodeb o wasanaethau, sefydliadau a chyfleusterau yn ardal Llansannan. I ychwanegu cofnod, cysylltwch â'r Clerc.</p>
    <p lang="en">This directory offers a summary of services, organisations and facilities in the Llansannan area. To add a listing, contact the Clerk.</p>

    <div style="margin:1.5rem 0">
      <!-- Placeholder entries — clerk to populate -->
      <h3 style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:0.5rem">A</h3>
