        </li>
        <li>
          <strong><span lang="cy">Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan</span><span lang="en">Llansannan Community Council</span></strong><br>
          <a href="/contact/"><span lang="cy">Gwefan a manylion cyswllt</span><span lang="en">Website and contact details</span></a>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:0.5rem">E</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong><span lang="cy">Eglwys Sant Sannan</span><span lang="en">St Sannan's Church</span></strong><br>
          <span lang="cy">Yn y pentref</span><span lang="en">In the village</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:0.5rem">N</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong><span lang="cy">Neuadd Bentref Llansannan</span><span lang="en">Llansannan Village Hall</span></strong><br>
          <span lang="cy">Lleoliad cyfarfodydd y cyngor a digwyddiadau cymunedol</span>
          <span lang="en">Venue for council meetings and community events</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:0.5rem">Y</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong lang="cy">Ysgol Bro Aled</strong><strong lang="en">Bro Aled School</strong><br>
          <span lang="cy">Ysgol gynradd yr ardal</span><span lang="en">The local primary school</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="upload-note">
      <p lang="cy">Mae'r cyfeiriadur hwn yn cael ei ddatblygu. I ychwanegu eich busnes neu sefydliad, cysylltwch â <a href="/contact/">y Clerc</a>.</p>
